<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Juda Cakuat</book>
  <para style="h">Juda Cakuat</para>
  <para style="toc1">Juda Cakuat</para>
  <para style="toc2">Juda Cakuat</para>
  <para style="mt">Juda Cakuat</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesuh Khrih ih siahhlawh le Jeim ih nau keimah Juda in Pathian kawhmi, Pathian kan Pa ih duhdawtmi le Jesuh Khrih humhimnak sungih a ummi pawl nan hnenah hi ca ka lo kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian zaangfahnak le daihnak le duhdawtnak cu famkim zetin nan ta si hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka duhdawtmi unau tla, kan zatein kan pomtlaangmi rundamnak thu hi nan hnenah ca in ka thiam tawkin ka ngan; Pathian in a mithiang hnenah kumkhua daihin a pekmi zumnak thu ahhin taimak suah in ṭang uhla zuam uh tiah a hleice in ka lo forh duh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ziangahtile kan lakah Pathian ziangih a siar lotu pawl kan theih loin an lut ih an ziaza ṭha lomi thuh awknak ah Pathian zaangfahnak thuthang kha a pingpeng in an sim ih kan hrangah Bawi le Lal a si mi Jesuh Khrih kha an hnong. Hi bangtuk minung pawl cu siatralnak an tong ding tiah Ca Thianghlim in hlanlai ihsin a rak sim cia zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Israel mi pawl Izipt ram ihsin a suah ih neh hnuah a zum lotu pawl cu siatralnak ah a thlenter ti hi nan theih ṭheh ciami a si ko naón nan theih sal dingah ka duhmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An thuneih theinak sungah um duh loin an umnak hmun a tlansantu vancungmi pawl kha ciing ringring uh. Annih cu leilung thuai khawthim sungah kumkhua in thir cikcin in khih an si ih a maksakmi Ni ah Pathian in an thu a ṭhen leh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih vancungmi vek thothoin Sodom le Gomorrah khua le a kiangkap khua pawl in nupa sualnak an tuah ih an tisa hiarnak an riamter ti kha hngilh hlah uh: annih pawl ih kumkhua meisa ih hremnak an tuarmi kha mi hmuahhmuah hrangah ralrin peknak a si ti a fiang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cubangtuk ṭhiamṭhiam in tuihsan minung pawl khal an si: hmuhnak kan nei an ti ih an taksa an borhhlawhter; Pathian thuneihnak kha an nautat ih vanih a ummi mi sunglawi pawl an zawmtai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vancungmi lakih a upa bik Mikhael hman in cubangtuk in a tuah lo. Moses ih ruak zo in a co ding tiah Satan thawn thu an el awk tikah nautatnak ṭongkam thawn Satan cu a camriam ngam lo; “Bawipa in a lo kawk!” tiah a ti meen a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla hi minung pawl cun an theih thei lomi thu poh kha nautatnak thawn an relsiat. Cule ramsa bangtuk in an taksa duhnak in an theih theimi thil pawl cu anmah lala siatsuahtu ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hmakhua a va pit so! An thlunmi cu Kain ih a rak thlunmi lamzin a si. Paisa duh ruangah Balaam ih a rak tuahmi sualnak ah an taksa pum an pe aw. Korah vekin ral an tho ih Korah bangtuk in siatralnak ah an thleng ve a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pawlkomnak rawl nan eitlaang tikah ningzahnak malte hman nei loin an ei an in ruangah a lo hmelsia tertu an si. Anmah ih zawn lawng an ruat. Thli in a zuanpi rero naón ruahti a zawi lomi khawdur bangtuk an si. Fur hmanah rah a nei lomi thingkung bangtuk an si; a hramih phawi suak ih a thi ngahmi thingkung bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ṭihnungza tisumsuar bangtuk an si; ningzakza an ziaza ṭha lo cu tiphuul bangin an phuan burhbo; arsi zuang bangtuk an si ih a thuk bik khawthimnak hmunah kumkhua an umnak dingah Pathian in umnak a ngaihtuah sak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Adam ihsin sanruknak a si mi Enok in himi pawl thuhla hi a rak sim cia zo. “Pathian cu a vancungmi, mithiang thawng tampi thawn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />mi hmuahhmuah thuṭhen dingah le Pathian ṭihzahnak zianghman nei loin thil a tuahtu hmuahhmuah le Pathian upatnak zianghman nei lo misual pawl in tuksumza ṭongsiava thawn Amah a relsiattu pawl an thu ṭhen dingah a ra ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himi pawl cu an phunzai ringring ih catloin midang an relsia, a ṭha lomi an tisa duhnak an thlun; anmah le anmah an khaisaang aw ih an thuthu in ziang hmuahhmuah a feh theinak dingah midang an porh ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka duhdawtmi tla, kan Bawipa Jesuh Khrih ih tirhthlah pawl in an rak lo zirhnak kha ciing ringring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nan hnenih an simmi cu, Ni netnak a thlen tikah nanmah a lo hnihsantu le Pathian ṭihzahnak nei loin anmah ih tisa duhnak a thluntu an suak ding,” tihi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himi pawl cu ṭhenṭheknak a suahtertu le tisa duhnak ih a ukmi le Thlarau a nei lotu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Asinain nannih ka duhdawtmi pawl cu a thianghlimmi nan zumnak parah ṭhangso vivo uh. Thlarau Thianghlim cahnak thawn thla cam uhla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />kan Bawipa Jesuh Khrih in a zaangfahnak thawn kumkhua nunnak a lo pek ding ni nan hngah laiah hin Pathian ih duhdawtnak sungah hmun ringring uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rinhmainak a neimi parah zaangfahnak nei uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />midang pawl kha meisa sung ihsin suah uhla rundam suak uh; cule a dang pawl parah zaangfahnak le ṭihnak langter uh, sikhalsehla an tisa hiar sualnak in a hnawihnihmi an hnipuan pawl cu hua uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tlu suak loin a lo kilkhawi ih sualmawhnak nei loin lungawinak thawn a sunglawimi a umnak ah a lo thlenter theitu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />amah lawng kan Pathian le Runtu a si mi hnen ahcun, kan Bawipa Jesuh Khrih thawngin a cem ciami caan ah siseh, atu le hmailam caanah siseh, sunlawinak, thawmliannak, cahnak le thuneihnak cu kumkhua in kumkhua tiang um camcin hram seh. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
